igibility":null,"official_course_url":"https://akpgc.in/courses/","verification_status":"verified_programme_family","career_path_mappings":[{"career_node_id":3,"career_node_slug":"bca","career_breadcrumb":"Maths / PCM > BCA (Computer Applications)","relation":"closest-specialization: Computer Applications","confidence":"low","mapping_status":"reviewed_with_career_tree_label_issue"}],"mapping_gap":null}],"agent_notes":["NIRF 2025 lists Arya Kanya Degree College in Prayagraj, Uttar Pradesh; the official University of Allahabad site also links the institution to akpgc.in.","Normal TLS verification for akpgc.in failed with the managed proxy's self-signed certificate-chain error; public GETs then used curl --insecure only for the expected akpgc.in host.","The official catalogue is partial and internally inconsistent: U.G., P.G., professional-course, and CCC landing pages have empty or placeholder bodies; the older /courses/ page lists two Ph.D. subjects and CCCA, while /about-college/ (modified 2025) lists six doctoral subjects.","The six doctoral offerings stated on /about-college/ are retained pending manual review; current 2026-27 doctoral admissions were not independently found.","The official BA catalogue labels the self-finance fine-arts offering as Painting on /bachelor-of-arts/ but Visual and Fine Arts on /courses/; the MA catalogue similarly uses Hindi and Hindi (Lit) across pages.","The official Mehendi page documents a 3 September 2025 to 6 November 2025 short-term certificate course and it was excluded as expired; no current 2026 session was found."]}